+### Opaque and total symbols
+
+The supplied semantics declares these 25 symbolic/trusted primitives:
+
+`intFloatDiv`, `divII`, `floatMod`, `floatLt`, `absF`, `floorFI`, `toF`,
+`ceilF`, `subF`, `divF`, `addF`, `mulF`, `powF`, `gtF`, `eqF`,
